{"4300690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Revival", "steam_appid": 4300690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Revival</strong> is a third-person sci-fi action-adventure set in a vast interconnected world. Hunt colossal bosses, solve environmental puzzles, and salvage alien technology to repair your ship and escape a hostile planet. Your choices matter — save or ignore survivors, unlocking new missions, allies in combat, and narrative consequences that shape your journey through a dynamic, atmospheric world.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a ruined world:</strong> Uncover the story behind the planet’s decay while navigating environmental puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master agile combat:</strong> Grapple, dash, and leap to outmaneuver colossal bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Impact the story:</strong> Every character you meet has a story, and your choices influence how the world reacts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic environments:</strong> Weather and environmental effects change combat strategies and shape story interactions.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Revival</strong> is a third-person sci-fi action-adventure set in a vast interconnected world. Hunt colossal bosses, solve environmental puzzles, and salvage alien technology to repair your ship and escape a hostile planet. Your choices matter — save or ignore survivors, unlocking new missions, allies in combat, and narrative consequences that shape your journey through a dynamic, atmospheric world.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a ruined world:</strong> Uncover the story behind the planet’s decay while navigating environmental puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master agile combat:</strong> Gra